It appears that if you are being blasted by a black dragon in version
3.1.1 you stand to lose your armor but not your life.

That is, once your armor has been disintegrated, the next breath
weapon attack that hits does absolutely nothing.  I tried this out in
wizard mode and in discovery mode (using wimpy, non disintegration
resistant characters), so it isn't just a wizard mode bug.

